development, completed independently outside of any employment obligations.

PRODUCTS:
- ISMS CORE Framework (SSE): Full governance product for mature organisations
  (POL + IMP-UG/TG + SCR + WKBK + REF + CTX + FORM)
- ISMS CORE Operational: Lightweight product for SMEs
  (OP-POL + SCR + compliance checklist workbooks)
- ISMS CORE Privacy: ISO 27701:2025 extension — privacy information management
  (PRIV-POL + IMP-UG/TG — controller, processor, and shared roles)
- ISMS CORE Cloud: ISO 27018:2025 extension — PII protection in public cloud
  (CLD-POL + IMP-UG/TG — consent, transfer, accountability, sub-processor management)

PLATFORM:
- ISMS CORE Platform: Docker-based self-hosted compliance management system
  (FastAPI + PostgreSQL + React + OpenSearch + Redis + Celery)
  Features: live compliance dashboards, gap & evidence management, 44 automated
  connectors, 11 compliance assessment modules, cross-framework correlation
  (2,730+ mappings), AI QA engine, RBAC, projects workspace

STANDARDS COVERED:
- ISO/IEC 27001:2022 — Information security management (53 control groups, 93 controls)
- ISO/IEC 27701:2025 — Privacy information management (21 control groups)
- ISO/IEC 27018:2025 — PII protection in public cloud (12 control groups)
- ISO/IEC 27017:2025 — Security controls for cloud services (forthcoming, expected mid-2026)

